# ANSITST - Exercise the ANSI personality

```text
ANSITST
```

## Run the test

With ANSI.RSX active, run ANSITST and press a key when prompted. The
position marker belongs at row 5, column 10 (zero-based). The word
Reverse should stand out between the normal samples.

## Erase and reset

The suffix after KEEP should disappear. The reset exercise should leave
readable text after an incomplete address sequence. If escape characters
print as text, check the active personality with [RSX](RSX.HLP).
